        "recordSha256": "70761d9fd82812ae0994a46662fc54954b2ad18d8948acd394415bcd99c272f6",
        "individualQuestion": "Preserve ALL ENEMIES IN30FT RADIUS seeing the ENTIRE BATTLEFIELD DIFFERENTLY; Core Action/range30ft/Instantaneous. Define finite duration/concentration,save,initial audience and exact sensory changes the caster chooses. Give a usable bounded illusion procedure for terrain,creature identity/position and visible hazards while retaining actual physical geometry. Resolve disbelief,interaction,alternative senses,true-seeing effects and conflicting perceptions without automatic mind control or new solid obstacles. The whole-battlefield promise needs a defined perceived extent; changing entry/exit or allegiance cannot silently add permanent victims. Actual damage,resources and movement remain recorded even when perceived differently."
      },
      "completeHistoricalCommonQuestionUnchanged": "For every selected spell, settle all operational fields: actual activation and components, legal target/range/geometry, duration and concentration, resolution/DC/save or attack, full effect clauses, scaling, repeat casting/source identity, suppression/ending, limits and class-specific rank/cost access. Preserve printed clauses and every original source. Explicitly label NEW completions; no external-game import or automatic historical alias merge.",
