        "recordSha256": "9977266e7c00d4b76d27ac333a8661e881b7ac0c40b8f1259f524a426840bc44",
        "individualQuestion": "Preserve a DRAGON ILLUSION that FRIGHTENS and deals PSYCHIC DAMAGE; Core Action/120ft/concentration up to1minute. Supply finite size,placement,movement/control cost,sensory channels,damage amount/type area and trigger cadence with exact save outcomes. Define Frightened duration,repeat resistance,disbelief,physical interaction and whether the image is targetable. A complete visual profile is not a real creature with independent turns,loot,breath types or a borrowed dragon statblock. Retain damage/fear as real printed functions while limiting repeated sight/entry triggers through source-event history. No new draconic cosmology or actual dragon summoning follows."
      },
