        "recordSha256": "14e4109212d78ef9ab08346cbe7fdaf3e8caf6e2f149a5b69b4903545c33f90e",
        "individualQuestion": "Preserve the target BELIEVING IT IS DYING and DROPPING TO0HP ILLUSIONARILY; Core Action/120ft/concentration up to1minute. Define initial resistance and the concrete perceived-zero state separately from actual currentHP. Determine consciousness,actions,movement,death saves,healing and reactions of observers,including how real damage during the illusion is tracked. Ending/disbelief must restore accurate perception without healing actual wounds or resetting death history. Do not turn the illusion into automatic death,resurrection or temporaryHP merely because zero is printed. Bind any incapacitation to the native hard-control rules and provide finite escape/end timing."
      },
