        "individualQuestion": "Preserve both Enchantment and Illusion placements: an OBJECT OR LOCATION ATTRACTS OR REPELS CERTAIN CREATURES; Core Action/120ft/Instantaneous. Define one chosen mode,actual object/site,size,creature selection criteria,area,duration/concentration and resistance. Specify concrete native movement/action consequences,approach/escape distance,danger handling and repeated save timing instead of undefined emotional flavor. Resolve mobile objects,existing occupants,forced movement and hidden identity criteria without an omniscient targeting oracle. Attraction is not general domination or automatic loyalty; repulsion does not supply damage or teleportation. Retain the two choices and each version while preventing repeated boundary crossings from granting extra compulsory turns."
      },
