        "individualQuestion": "Preserve YOU CANNOT BE DETECTED AS LYING BY ANY MEANS; Core Action/120ft/Instantaneous. Resolve self wording versus range and finite duration/concentration. Define how this absolute anti-detection promise interacts with native truth/lie spells,mind reading,Insight and ordinary contradictory evidence. Distinguish preventing detection of a lie from compelling belief,making a statement true,erasing witnesses or guaranteeing successful persuasion. Preserve the unusually broad clause rather than quietly reducing it to advantage,but state a playable observable result for protected inquiries. No unprinted minimum die roll,Charisma score change or permanent social control is imported."
