          ]
        },
        "historicalQuestion": "Preserve a10ft SPHERE that SUPPRESSES magical effects and spells, Core Action/range10ft/Instantaneous. Resolve sphere radius versus diameter,center/following,finite lifetime/concentration and genuine line/geometry before application. Define exact magical-source eligibility,rank limits if any explicitly NEW,artifact or class-feature exceptions,entry/exit and suppression of objects,ongoing effects,summons,buffs,curses and the field itself. Suppression differs from dispelling and from retroactively reversing completed healing,movement,expenditure or material changes. Bind real parent/rider clocks,spent charges,damage/temporary-HP records and resume behavior; no clock reset,deferred burst or returned ingredient on exit. Resolve casting/cost inside the field,cross-boundary effects and self-overlap using actual source records, not a blanket deletion of all supernatural flavor.",
        "historicalProposalEvidence": {
          "spellId": "antimagic-field-lesser",
          "procedure": "KEEP Action,range10feet and a10-foot sphere suppressing magical effects/spells. NEW10feet is RADIUS, centered on one perceived fixed point within10feet; it does not follow a creature. Concentration up to60seconds explicitly replaces Instantaneous. Its volume is limited by actual solid total-cover barriers from the center; it does not burrow through a closed wall. It has no physical boundary, damage, pressure, air removal or movement restriction. No rank ceiling is proposed: actual eligible spells of any rank and explicitly magical components are suppressed within its covered volume, subject only to genuine source-specific immunity. An artifact, divine title or class name receives no invented exception; an actual written protected-source exception keeps its scope. NEW each instance of this same Lesser Antimagic field is exempt from suppression by this same family, so overlapping fields form the union of their active volumes rather than an oscillating mutual shutdown. This exemption permits maintaining an existing field, not creating new magic from within another already-active field. Independent effects that specifically suppress this field apply by their own rules. Concentration maintenance itself remains possible inside; field creation does not cancel remote already-established effects merely because their concentrating caster entered. It suppresses the actual local expression/affected component, not a distant source solely through caster ownership. A creature-attached magical benefit/condition or discrete magical item is wholly suppressed while any of that body/item's actual occupied volume intersects the covered sphere; a large freestanding area/barrier is suppressed only in its actual intersection. A merely overlapping target space does not suppress unrelated creatures elsewhere. Created summons use their source's suppression placement/history rules; real animated bodies become inert only if their actual animation source says so. Magic items retain their mundane body/profile and inventory while their actual magical enhancements/actions are unavailable; intrinsic mundane functions do not vanish. If no ordinary fallback profile exists, do not fabricate one as an extra weapon/armor entitlement. Nonmagical class abilities, learned facts, RP maxima/records, physical injuries, completed ordinary material creation/transmutation, finished teleportation, restoredHP and consumed items are not rolled back. A continuing spell curse is suppressed only in its magical components; a persistent mundane disease or intrinsic nonmagical trait is not automatically cured. A present magical tempHP/buffer grant is unavailable while suppressed but retains its remaining balance and original ending; no damage then absorbed from it, no later refund of HP loss. The ordinary single-grant/strongest-buffer records still apply to another actual accepted grant, with no second hidden usable bank. Suppressing a changed body uses the reviewed body/root/meld/placement rules; it does not clone gear or close-and-recapture its meld set. A legal spell cast may still be committed inside if its ordinary nonmagical casting permissions/components/resources exist: pay full applicable costs and cadence, but suppress its payload before application. Suppressed focus enhancements do not destroy a mundane casting focus. An instantaneous component originating inside, or whose required actual source-to-target/initial-origin path crosses the covered volume, cannot resume that same component beyond the field. A caster outside cannot choose an area center beyond it to bypass an intercepted originating path. Once a persistent source was legally established outside, its later actual origin and local intersection govern: suppress only intersecting portions without retroactively countering the whole old cast. No free list of what failed/which ranks or secret curses is supplied. Leaving/ending suppression restores only still-live permitted expressions, originalHP/buff balances and clocks; missed damage/healing/orders/saves that were unavailable are not queued. Any source that still permits an ending save while suppressed retains it. Ending the field does not refill charges, renew expiries, refund prices or recall dropped gear.",
          "newChoices": "NEW fixed10-foot-radius concentration minute, actual-source local suppression without rank cap, same-family self/overlap exemption, explicit cast/cross-boundary pricing and body/item/buffer history rules. Instantaneous consequences stay real.",
          "workedCases": [
            "AB5-01-A: A caster inside the active sphere commits an otherwise legal rank-five spell, spending10RP and its ordinary cadence. Its payload is suppressed and receives no later delayed resolution on leaving. An already-established remote buff outside the sphere is not canceled merely because its concentrating caster entered it.",
            "AB5-01-B: A body-attached magical buffer has12remaining when the bearer enters. It cannot absorb a new8damage packet inside; leaving within its original lifetime restores the same12remaining, not20and not an8HP refund. Ordinary stone already created by an instantaneous material spell remains real, and two Lesser Antimagic fields do not switch each other on and off indefinitely."
          ],
          "questionId": "AB5-01",
          "originalQuestion": "Preserve a10ft SPHERE that SUPPRESSES magical effects and spells, Core Action/range10ft/Instantaneous. Resolve sphere radius versus diameter,center/following,finite lifetime/concentration and genuine line/geometry before application. Define exact magical-source eligibility,rank limits if any explicitly NEW,artifact or class-feature exceptions,entry/exit and suppression of objects,ongoing effects,summons,buffs,curses and the field itself. Suppression differs from dispelling and from retroactively reversing completed healing,movement,expenditure or material changes. Bind real parent/rider clocks,spent charges,damage/temporary-HP records and resume behavior; no clock reset,deferred burst or returned ingredient on exit. Resolve casting/cost inside the field,cross-boundary effects and self-overlap using actual source records, not a blanket deletion of all supernatural flavor.",
