              "true-seeing"
            ],
            "submittedQuestion": "Decide the preserved two-placement union, recipient-centered60ft and observer-only darkness/invisibility/illusion/original-appearance scope without wall/fog/Blinded bypass or secret identity. Decide explicit Mental Prison exit bridge using full actual pending record and N29:entry28 and exit24 remain two packets, not one52Wound event. This conference does not approve the full separate Mental Prison source.",
            "disposition": "ACCEPT_TRUE_SEEING_ONLY_CONDITIONAL_BRIDGE",
            "rationale": "Accept both preserved True Seeing placement benefits as one identity while retaining each class's actual school access. Accept appearance-only transformation limits and the exact conditional Mental Prison departure bridge. Do not approve Mental Prison or Control15.",
