            "submittedQuestion": "Decide five finite stationary fake images, apparentAC10 and10ft6d6psychic burst on actual qualifying attack roll hit or miss. Explicitly decide NEW IP14-IMAGE-TARGET-09, narrowing to actual ordinary weapon/unarmed Attack Action rather than waiving creature-only spell/class/profile targets. Actual Ray of Frost counterexampleN31 preserves hidden-eligibility costs/no diagnostic. Decide NEW IP14-SPECTRAL-ROOT-08: originalcaster dealer and per-recipient roots for each separate later image discharge using current dealerNull, private sharedpool, no imagecreature/procs/chain explosions. Earlier broader companion sentence is preserved.",
            "disposition": "ACCEPT_AFTER_EXACT_REPAIR",
