          },
          "candidatePointer": "/completeOriginalSharedProposals/0/completeOriginalSharedProposal/assetsAndControl",
          "scope": "Only listed accepted Illusion14 cards. Named rules for other cards grant no capability here. Actual accepted interfaces and each selected current procedure control their explicit scopes and exceptions."
        },
        "IP14-SOURCE1-damageHealingAndCosts": {
          "id": "IP14-SOURCE1-damageHealingAndCosts",
          "completeText": "KEEP typed damage defenses, actual prevention/sharing, buffers, life-state rules, Wounds and concentration. Save-half floors before the relevant defenses. Numeric actualDamageDealt is temporary HP absorbed plus actual normal HP lost, excluding overkill and prevented HP-floor loss. For a permitted drain sum eligible terminal recipient branches once, never both a split parent and its children; apply the card’s narrower funding predicate before its final half/floor. HP restoration uses actual healing restrictions and maximums and grants no automatic Wound cure, resurrection or resource refresh. Direct HP payment is separate from damage: no resistance, buffer, transfer, Wound/damage trigger or damage-derived refund. It must be paid from real normal HP under the card’s explicit floor. No necrotic, shadow, plague or soul name creates an unprinted condition, material, pool or setting fact.",
          "applicableSpellIds": [
            "greater-phantom-steed"
          ],
          "source": {
            "path": "DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible/data/director/spell_proposals/illusion_necromancy_rank4.json",
