        },
        "IP14-SOURCE3-control": {
          "id": "IP14-SOURCE3-control",
          "completeText": "KEEP actual condition components and the source-character/target/encounter shared hard-control allowance. Successful establishment of whole-Action/turn control or Paralyzed/Unconscious claims it once; immunity/prevention or prior history prevents that hard component without banking it. Charmed-only immunity does not block a distinct non-Charmed effect; actual broader defenses retain their scope. Compelled ordinary movement can provoke ordinary opportunity attacks and spends real remaining movement. No missing Action, extra turn, Bonus Action, Reaction, owner command budget or new movement mode is created. Use reviewed earliest-specific-instruction priority, then stable application/ID ties; compatible demands may share only the same genuine execution. Costs, ownership, actual absolute prohibitions and limited resources remain real.",
          "applicableSpellIds": [
            "mass-mirage",
