      "exactSourceOrConflict": "All five actual accesses are Wizard rank8, minimum class level15, base21RP. Antipathy/Sympathy preserves Enchantment and Illusion placements but only assigned Enchantment access. Glibness says YOU but Core range120ft; three Core records say Instantaneous despite ongoing effects.",
