      "recommendationAndConsequences": "Recommend first as source-faithful but require GPT to define exact battlefield extent and permitted mappings. Apparent terrain/hazards and creature appearances/positions may change only through explicitly authored mapping rules. Do not grant the caster hidden geometry, remote senses, identity information or control of subsequent choices. Real bodies, cover, movement costs, support, targeting and effect origins remain authoritative; hidden invalid target attempts need a scoped paid-failure rule, not automatic reuse of Spectral Army’s narrow exception.",
