      "recommendationAndConsequences": "Recommend first with Action INT/Investigation versus original DC on genuinely new evidence and no unchanged retry farming. Define whether an immediate contradiction ends the whole battlefield mapping or only a local element. Functioning nonvisual senses retain actual evidence; blindness prevents visual deception without invented immunity. True Seeing operates within its real60ft sensory extent, so GPT must decide local piercing versus whole-application ending rather than extending it globally by accident.",
