  "sourceFindings": [
    "All five actual access rows are Wizard rank8, level15, base21RP. Antipathy/Sympathy has two preserved placements but no actual Illusion access.",
    "Phantom Execution explicitly says illusionarily0HP, so real damage/death and genuine Unconscious are separate consequential choices.",
    "Glibness says by any means; its broad promise cannot silently shrink to advantage, but Zone of Truth is behavioral restriction, not detection.",
    "Mass Hallucination audience radius and entire-battlefield illusion extent are separate questions. Physical geometry and hidden target validity remain real.",
    "Illusory Dragon has real printed fear/psychic functions but no actual creature or numerical attack profile. New numbers are provisional authorship, not sourced balance approval.",
    "Actual accepted True Seeing pierces sensory falsehood personally within its extent, does not globally cancel independent psychic damage or hard control, and requires actually usable sensory channels.",
    "Actual Illusion14 acceptance is included even though local index application is staged. Its nine holds and original artifact bytes remain intact.",
    "Historical tabletop headings are preserved source evidence only; all new decisions target deterministic video-game execution."
  ],
  "futureCaseRequirements": [
    "At least two fully specified deterministic cases per spell after selections, with actual Wizard access/RP, geometry, channels, timing, RNG, defenses, true state and observer knowledge.",
    "Hallucination: hidden hostile audience, remapped battlefield versus real bodies/cover, conclusive local contradiction and limited True Seeing extent, no late victim addition.",
    "Dragon: image placement and movement, actual paid breath and fear outcomes, fear immunity versus psychic immunity, distinct Null roots, suppression/expiry without replay.",
    "Phantom Execution: illusory0 at positive actualHP, genuine damage to actual0/death, actual healing/ally assistance/escape, hard-guard prevention and real concentration loss only if chosen state entails it.",
    "Antipathy/Sympathy: actual filter and mode, mobile object, existing occupants and first exposure, shared movement budget under grapple/Speed0, no entry replay, separate ending saves.",
    "Glibness: Zone of Truth prohibition, true factual contradiction without intentional-lie certification, actual mind-reading channel, statements before/during/after effect, suppression and previously reached conclusions.",
    "No content-dependent branch receives success credit from fabricated creature profiles, undefined hostility/filter predicates or absent geometry. Specification arithmetic is not production runtime validation."
  ],
